SUMMARY:Where Cool Water Flows
DESCRIPTION:Artist and California Naturalist Jessie Wright shares her bright\, playful paintings of people experiencing the collective joy of nature. Her art show\, WHERE COOL WATER FLOWS\, features a combination of watercolor and ink\, oil\, and acrylic paintings\, a refreshing sight on a summer’s day while enjoying a cold beer at the Super Owl Brewing in West Davis.
