SUMMARY:Animal Behavior Summer Camps\, 2026!
DESCRIPTION:Become an Animal Behavior Scientist for a Week! | Ages 10–15 \nSpend a week at Pine Trails Ranch in west Davis stepping into the role of a real animal behavior biologist! Through hands-on activities and field-style investigations\, campers discover how animal behavior science protects wildlife\, improves animal welfare\, and opens doors to exciting careers.​ \nDuring the week\, students will:\nTrack and observe animal behavior\nCollect and interpret real data\nExplore science-based training techniques\nCreate enrichment that keeps animals curious and thriving\nStudy both captive and wild species \n 
